# Deploy footprint for billing-service on Railway. Uploaded from the repo
# root so supabase/ stays a sibling directory to billing-service/ (needed —
# billing-service spawns supabase/provision-tenant.mjs as a child process,
# see billing-service/lib/provision.mjs). Everything else in the repo is
# irrelevant to this service and excluded, same spirit as DEPLOY.md's list
# for the PHP host but inverted (there supabase/ is excluded; here it's the
# one thing besides billing-service/ that must be included).

# The website itself — not this service's concern.
android/
assets/
css/
help-center/
js/
Marketing/
tests/
vendor/
*.png
*.zip
*.webmanifest
index.html
knowledge-base.html
sw.js
.htaccess
.well-known/

# Root-level PHP endpoints and their config — not this service either.
*.php

# Repo/tooling noise. Leading slash anchors these to the repo root ONLY —
# without it, "package.json" would also match billing-service/package.json
# and supabase/package.json, which is exactly what npm install needs to
# find. (This bit us on the first deploy attempt — fixed here.)
.git/
.claude/
.agents/
/node_modules/
/README.md
/CHANGES.md
/DEPLOY.md
/package.json
/package-lock.json

# supabase/ subfolder: keep only what provision-tenant.mjs/fleet-migrate.mjs
# need (schema, migrations, the scripts themselves, their own package.json).
# Exclude the admin dashboard (never deployed anywhere, local-only tool),
# the manifests directory (can carry adminEmail from past runs), any local
# node_modules (Railway's build installs fresh for the right platform), and
# absolutely never the secrets file.
supabase/admin-dashboard/
supabase/manifests/
supabase/node_modules/
supabase/.env.local
supabase/.env
supabase/*.md
supabase/schema-demo-dump.sql
supabase/schema.sql.pre-step3-backup.sql
supabase/seed_demo.sql
supabase/reset_demo.sql

# billing-service's own node_modules — Railway's build installs these
# fresh too, don't ship a Windows-built copy into a Linux container.
billing-service/node_modules/
billing-service/.env.local
billing-service/.env
